<figure id="S6.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S6.T2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE II</span>: </span><span id="S6.T2.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Quantitative comparison on the DIV2K dataset across different total kernel pool sizes. Metrics include PSNR, SSIM, and LPIPS, showing how increasing the kernel pool improves reconstruction quality. R-SMoE achieves competitive quality with significantly fewer kernels.</span></figcaption>
