<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F6.11" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 6</span>: </span><span id="S6.F6.12" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Visualization of image regression results <span id="S6.F6.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">at 6000 kernels for</span> RBF <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">32</a>]</cite>, GSMoE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite>, GaussianImage <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">5</a>]</cite>, and the proposed R-SMoE. <span id="S6.F6.12.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Two regions from the original image (left) are cropped and enlarged to highlight differences in edge sharpness and fine-structure reconstruction.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S6.F7" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><img src="2510.05814v1/figures/DIV2K/s_0882_1_original_6000.png" id="S6.F7.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:153/229;" width="153" height="229" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><img src="2510.05814v1/figures/DIV2K/s_0882_1_gs_r_6000.png" id="S6.F7.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:153/229;" width="153" height="229" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><img src="2510.05814v1/figures/DIV2K/s_0882_1_smoe_r_6000.png" id="S6.F7.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:153/229;" width="153" height="229" alt="Refer to caption"></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="S6.F7.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.05814v1/figures/DIV2K/s_0821_1_original_6000.png" id="S6.F7.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:153/229;" width="153" height="229" alt="Refer to caption">
